<header><div class="kicker">Fortress revival · 2026-09-29</div><h1>Pavol's decisions since 16 September, judged against the designers' intent</h1><p>A top-tier review of every decision since the goal was set, checked at the designers' own texts. Chips on each decision give the verdict; section 6 lists what to decide, in order.</p></header>
